---
import {
  functionalExact,
  sampleVariation,
  variationModel,
} from '../../../data/part07/functionalVariationModel.mjs';

const xToSvg = (x) => 58 + 524 * x;
const yToSvg = (y) => 246 - (y + 0.3) * (206 / 1.1);
const toPath = (samples, key) => samples
  .map((point, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${xToSvg(point.x).toFixed(2)} ${yToSvg(point[key]).toFixed(2)}`)
  .join(' ');

const defaultSamples = sampleVariation(variationModel.defaultEpsilon, 161);
const basePath = toPath(defaultSamples, 'base');
const variedPath = toPath(defaultSamples, 'varied');
const fallbackRows = [-0.5, 0, 0.5].map((epsilon) => ({
  epsilon,
  value: functionalExact(epsilon),
}));
---

<figure class="chapter-visual variation-explorer" data-variation-explorer>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：函数空间中的方向变分</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: a directional variation in function space</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls">
    <label>
      <span>方向参数 ε | Direction parameter ε</span>
      <input
        type="range"
        min={variationModel.epsilonRange[0]}
        max={variationModel.epsilonRange[1]}
        step="0.01"
        value={variationModel.defaultEpsilon}
        data-variation-epsilon
      />
      <output data-variation-epsilon-output>0.00</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="variation-title variation-desc">
    <title id="variation-title">Base function and varied function along a direction</title>
    <desc id="variation-desc">
      The base function is x times one minus x on the unit interval. The admissible direction is sine of pi x, so both endpoints remain fixed while epsilon changes the interior curve.
    </desc>
    <line x1="58" y1="246" x2="582" y2="246" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="58" y1="40" x2="58" y2="246" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="58" y1={yToSvg(0)} x2="582" y2={yToSvg(0)} class="plot-guide" />
    <path d={basePath} class="variation-explorer__base" />
    <path d={variedPath} class="plot-curve" data-variation-curve />
    <circle cx={xToSvg(0)} cy={yToSvg(0)} r="4" class="variation-explorer__endpoint" />
    <circle cx={xToSvg(1)} cy={yToSvg(0)} r="4" class="variation-explorer__endpoint" />
    <text x="582" y="272" text-anchor="end">x</text>
    <text x="25" y="48">fε(x)</text>
    <text x="58" y="272" text-anchor="middle">0</text>
    <text x="320" y="272" text-anchor="middle">0.5</text>
    <text x="582" y="272" text-anchor="middle">1</text>
    <text x="610" y="66" class="variation-explorer__legend-base">base f</text>
    <text x="610" y="89" class="variation-explorer__legend-varied">f + εη</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>泛函值 | Functional value:</span>
    <strong data-variation-functional>F[fε] = {functionalExact(0).toFixed(8)}</strong>
    <span>一阶变分 | First variation:</span>
    <strong>δF[f;η] = {variationModel.firstVariation.toFixed(8)}</strong>
    <span>二阶方向导数 | Second directional derivative:</span>
    <strong>d²F/dε² = {variationModel.secondVariation.toFixed(2)}</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="variation-explorer__fallback">
    <p><strong>无 JavaScript 参考表 | No-JavaScript reference table</strong></p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>ε</th><th>F[f + εη]</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {fallbackRows.map((row) => (
          <tr><td>{row.epsilon.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{row.value.toFixed(8)}</td></tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>定义域为 <code>[0,1]</code>，<code>f(x)=x(1−x)</code>，<code>η(x)=sin(πx)</code>，<code>fε=f+εη</code>，<code>F[f]=∫₀¹f(x)²dx</code>。所有量均为无量纲教学变量。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> on <code>[0,1]</code>, <code>f(x)=x(1−x)</code>, <code>η(x)=sin(πx)</code>, <code>fε=f+εη</code>, and <code>F[f]=∫₀¹f(x)²dx</code>. All quantities are dimensionless teaching variables.</p>
    <p><strong>输入与默认值：</strong><code>ε∈[−0.5,0.5]</code>，步长 0.01，默认 0；原生 range 控件支持键盘方向键。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Input and default:</strong> <code>ε∈[−0.5,0.5]</code> with step 0.01 and default 0; the native range control supports arrow-key operation.</p>
    <p><strong>解析验收：</strong><code>F(ε)=1/30+(8/π³)ε+(1/2)ε²</code>，因此 <code>F′(0)=8/π³</code>、<code>F″(0)=1</code>；两端始终为零。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Analytic acceptance:</strong> <code>F(ε)=1/30+(8/π³)ε+(1/2)ε²</code>, hence <code>F′(0)=8/π³</code> and <code>F″(0)=1</code>; both endpoints remain zero.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>该模型验证代码与一个光滑二次泛函一致，不证明一般泛函可微，也不表示真实电子密度的允许集合。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the model checks code against one smooth quadratic functional. It does not prove differentiability of a general functional or represent the admissible set of real electron densities.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  import {
    functionalExact,
    sampleVariation,
  } from '../../../data/part07/functionalVariationModel.mjs';

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-variation-explorer]').forEach((root) => {
    const input = root.querySelector('[data-variation-epsilon]');
    const epsilonOutput = root.querySelector('[data-variation-epsilon-output]');
    const functionalOutput = root.querySelector('[data-variation-functional]');
    const curve = root.querySelector('[data-variation-curve]');
    if (!(input instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(curve instanceof SVGPathElement)) return;

    const xToSvg = (x) => 58 + 524 * x;
    const yToSvg = (y) => 246 - (y + 0.3) * (206 / 1.1);

    const update = () => {
      const epsilon = Number(input.value);
      if (!Number.isFinite(epsilon)) return;
      const path = sampleVariation(epsilon, 161)
        .map((point, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${xToSvg(point.x).toFixed(2)} ${yToSvg(point.varied).toFixed(2)}`)
        .join(' ');
      curve.setAttribute('d', path);
      if (epsilonOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) epsilonOutput.value = epsilon.toFixed(2);
      if (functionalOutput instanceof HTMLElement) {
        functionalOutput.textContent = `F[fε] = ${functionalExact(epsilon).toFixed(8)}`;
      }
    };

    input.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .variation-explorer svg {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 34rem;
  }

  .variation-explorer {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .variation-explorer text {
    fill: currentColor;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .variation-explorer__base {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-dasharray: 7 5;
  }

  .variation-explorer__endpoint {
    fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
  }

  .variation-explorer__legend-base {
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }

  .variation-explorer__legend-varied {
    fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
  }

  .variation-explorer__fallback {
    max-width: 24rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }

  .variation-explorer__fallback table {
    width: 100%;
  }
</style>
